WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.557
Unit nine. Food for Growing Bodies!

2
00:00:04.507 --> 00:00:08.178
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.228 --> 00:00:11.594
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:15.686
Today we learn about Food for Growing Bodies. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.466 --> 00:00:20.266
Protein. Say it with me. Protein!

6
00:00:23.766 --> 00:00:27.566
Calcium. Say it with me. Calcium!

7
00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:34.397
Iron. Say it with me. Iron!

8
00:00:37.894 --> 00:00:41.694
Vegetables. Say it with me. Vegetables!

9
00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:48.973
Whole grains. Say it with me. Whole grains!

10
00:00:52.473 --> 00:00:55.807
Growth. Say it with me. Growth!

11
00:00:59.304 --> 00:01:03.054
Energy. Say it with me. Energy!

12
00:01:06.553 --> 00:01:10.219
Balanced. Say it with me. Balanced!

13
00:01:13.723 --> 00:01:22.066
Growing bodies need protein, calcium, and iron. Vegetables and whole grains give energy and nutrients. A balanced plate supports healthy growth.

14
00:01:22.116 --> 00:01:23.310
I can do that too!

15
00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:30.270
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:31.470
Iron!

17
00:01:32.299 --> 00:01:37.601
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.651 --> 00:01:38.801
Energy!

19
00:01:39.758 --> 00:01:45.763
Did you know? A simple guide is to fill half your plate with vegetables and fruit!

20
00:01:45.813 --> 00:01:47.883
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:48.576 --> 00:01:55.875
Think and answer. What does a balanced plate look like?

22
00:01:55.925 --> 00:01:57.075
Great answer!

23
00:01:58.296 --> 00:02:03.379
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:03.429 --> 00:02:06.137
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

